Package: heavilyright
Title: Heavily Right P-Value Combination and Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Tianle", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tylerliuthu@gmail.com")
Description: Native R implementations of heavily right-tailed p-value
    combination rules, calibrated null laws, and one- and multi-dimensional
    confidence-region inference. It keeps
    numerical diagnostics and calibration choices explicit and does not use
    Python as a computational backend.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.01065
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    nloptr (>= 2.1.0),
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.1.7)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
